  "about": "Editor spec §42, problem_codes: small blocks each reader refuses, and the stable code it refuses each with (src/reader/problem-codes.json). One table for the JavaScript and the Python reader, so they give the same code: read by problem-codes.test.mjs and python/graph_spec/tests/test_problem_codes.py. via says how a case is read: store, applied to a new Store; change, one change set statement read by readChange (read_change); to_gql, written as standard GQL by the Python library's to_gql. A case read by to_gql, or whose code the table gives to Python alone, is run by Python alone.",
